    "turn_text": "Hey, hey, hey, welcome, welcome, welcome. It is the Fox Across America game ball presentation ceremony brought to you every week by the fine folks at Fox Across America, where we highlight, we go back, we watch the game film. And we look at the one interview that stood out the most. This was, I gotta be honest, just an absolute food fight of a week. It really was a mess. But there was one interview in studio that I enjoyed. Listen, I enjoyed everything we did this week. We had James Comeron who talked about all the sleazy things the Bidens are doing with their bank accounts. We had Kevin Walling on in the same day, a guy who is actually a surrogate for Joe Biden. That's the kind of balance we have. Byron Donald's took us inside some house goings on and single item funding for Israel and all the stupid stuff going on in college campuses and the fact that nobody respects us around the world anymore. Everybody was kind of great and fun. Raymond Arroyo on Friday was hilarious. He came by and talked about a jazz album and told a lot of dirty jokes about the holidays and Ron DeSantis wearing lifts and his boots. But I give the game ball to a man who could have been the next speaker of the house, but is not. He is superstar representative from the fourth congressional district of Ohio. We had a lot of laughs. We talked a lot of sports. This was very much debauchery from start to finish. And I am talking about the presence of Ohio representative Jim Jordan, who comes up now to the podium and accepts his game ball. Hey, hey, hey, hey. It's your radio buddy, Jimmy Phala. And I will tell you this. If I'm searching for my next place to buy, my next place to rent, or I just want to scroll through some dream homes, I'm doing it on the Red Fin app. Jenny and I, we get so much entertainment out of this app. I know a lot of people are using it for business and rightfully so. But we will scroll and send each other homes and look at prices and find out everything you need to know. And that's what Redfin is doing. They make it fun to search all the homes for sale, all the apartments for rent in your neighborhood. You can filter for price, beds, baths, square footage, and so much more. And if you find a place you love, Redfin makes it easy to go see it in person, just schedule a tour, right from the app. It is that good. Plus, if you look at a cell, Redfin agents know how to get you the best price possible for your home. That's because they close twice as many deals as other agents. And with a listing fee as low as 1%. Redfin's fees are half of what others often charge, which means you'll have more money to put towards your next home. So whether you're looking to buy, rent, or sell, you're just entertaining yourself like me. Redfin's got you covered, download the Redfin app and get started. Hey Jimmy, how are you doing? Good. Is it not some of the best trick or treating in the world in",
